1
00:00:05,692 --> 00:00:08,692
(Bernadette:)-I love your shoes.
-Oh, thanks. They are cute, aren't they?

2
00:00:08,862 --> 00:00:10,572
(Bernadette:)-Where'd you get them?
-Shoes for Less.

3
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:15,080
(Bernadette:)-I've been meaning to go over there.
-Oh, great selection, great prices.

4
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:18,330
(Sheldon:)My mother was right. Hell is real.

5
00:00:19,372 --> 00:00:22,332
(Howard:)Come on, Sheldon,
let the women-folk chat.

6
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:26,210
(Penny:)Women-folk?

7
00:00:26,921 --> 00:00:28,711
(Howard:)Gals? Chicks?

8
00:00:28,882 --> 00:00:31,092
(Howard:)Utero-Americans?

9
00:00:32,552 --> 00:00:35,682
(Penny:)-Just eat your dinner.
-Don't take him too seriously.

10
00:00:35,847 --> 00:00:39,307
(Bernadette:)A lot of what he says
is intended as humor.

11
00:00:39,851 --> 00:00:41,931
(Penny:)Yeah, well,
I don't think it's very funny.

12
00:00:42,103 --> 00:00:45,563
(Bernadette:)Me neither,
but he just lights up when I laugh.

13
00:00:48,193 --> 00:00:50,523
(Penny:)Howard, never let her go.

14
00:00:52,363 --> 00:00:55,203
(Bernadette:)Leonard, Howard says you're working on
fundamental tests...

15
00:00:55,366 --> 00:00:58,706
(Bernadette:)-...of quantum mechanics.
-I am. Are you interested in physics?

16
00:00:58,870 --> 00:01:00,040
(Bernadette:)I find it fascinating.

17
00:01:00,371 --> 00:01:02,211
(Bernadette:)If I hadn't gone into microbiology...

